  {
   "id": "destroy-all-humans-2-reprobed-171214@patch-2023-02-21",
   "gameId": "destroy-all-humans-2-reprobed-171214",
   "displayName": "February Fixes Patch",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-02-21T09:12:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "General Fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a random issue that OJ18 - The Ravages of Mohgra could fail without a reason",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed random issues with Blisk enemies and Agent Oranchov showing wrong behavior when the Dislocator was used",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some stability issues where the combination of Saucer destruction on a city, followed by a player death thus restarting / reloading the last checkpoint would cause hangs or freezes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a balancing issue when Quantum Deconstructor and Sonic Boom are used together, causing the Quantum Deconstructor to do less damage",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some saucer camera behavior especially for looking down causing judders",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some Furon handbook entries being not unlocked properly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a music issue during ARK16 - The Coming of Arkvoodle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue that was caused by the alert level modification player cheat persisting wrongly across reloads",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Previously known issue in the last delivery] Fixed a random issue, Natalia getting stuck in the escort mission “SM15 - You Only Live 137 Times”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Previously known issue in the last delivery] Fixed a random issue, the Turret behavior in the mission “SM15 - You Only Live 137 Times”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For PC,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "All of the above, plus the corrective patch to the previously rolled-back patch. The rolled-back patch notes as originally you had are below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "General",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed so the Ninja Bodyguard mutator is no longer visible in certain cutscenes during mission 9 – “The Majestic File”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed a replay issue from the Holopox deck (mission 06 – “No Pox Please We're British”).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed that the subtitles do not follow the voice over during a cutscene in Oddjob 01 – “I Left My Parts In San Fran... Err, Bay City”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed an audio issue encountered in the cutscene after completing Arkvoodle mission 16 – “The Coming of Arkvoodle”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Fixed so the Dislocator will not lose ammo under certain circumstances in Solaris.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Fixed SFX issues in Takoshima",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Fixed a number of respawn issues in water",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Stability issues",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed a rare crash in Takoshima when the alert level is raised",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed a rare crash after an attack wave in mission 20 - \"The Comrade Who Came From The Cold\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed a rare crash at the end of mission 2 - \"Where Have All The Flower Children Gone?\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Community reported issues fixed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed a rare crash whilst exiting the Jukebox",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed that the Moghra egg in OddJob 18 – “The Ravages of Mohgra” is overly sensitive to disturbance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed so the proximity detector is now functioning when discovering Furotech Cell or Artefacts in Takoshima.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed an issue after Photo Mode in Solaris, where Crypto's breathing bubble is active in Bodysnatch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Fixed the Jukebox, so every song is playing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Fixed audio issues during a cutscene after completing Arkvoodle mission 16 – “The Coming of Arkvoodle”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Fixed audio issues during a cutscene in mission 16 – “Kojira Kaiju Battle”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Fixed an audio issue during a cutscene in OddJob 01 – “I Left My Parts In San Fran... Err, Bay City”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
