  {
   "id": "destroy-all-humans-2-reprobed-171214@major-2022-12-07",
   "gameId": "destroy-all-humans-2-reprobed-171214",
   "displayName": "'Tis the season to get FREE stuff!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-12-07T14:04:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New Free Content!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3 New merry Crypto skins",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1 New festive Saucer skin",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "General",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some stability issues: o Rare Multiplayer freeze after dying in Bay City waters,: o rare crash after Arkvoodle mission 13,: o potential game freeze issue after transmogging the courier’s vehicle in SM11,: o rare soft-lock in Multiplayer pause for Player 2,: o rare crash when Player 1 enters the saucer with Player 2 PK’ing a specific NPC,: o potential SM17 freeze during the escort step,: o rare Ion Detonator-related crash: o rare input-mashing related crash",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some issues around the bodysnatch ability: o Bodysnatched NPC models work properly with Selective X-Ray Vision mutator: o Fixed a case where powers and weapons might become unusable if bodysnatching an NPC and breaking line-of-sight at the right time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some audio issues: o Fixed some cutscenes music not playing properly: o Fixed an issue where Crypto’s three-point-landing with Smashdown unlocked would have no sound",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed objective blocker in Arkvoodle mission “Publicity Stunt”, where a hippie could be slurped and blocking the missions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some Blisk movement issues in SM07",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed tanks to have consistent physics behavior against Ion Detonator grenades",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some collision issues in Solaris",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed objective blocker in Oddjob mission “Ruin Lives - The Secretary!”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some issues with the Free Love ability to make it consistent in some gameplay instances",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed potential objective blocker in Oddjob mission 23 “The Abominable Yeti”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed potential objective blocker in Arkvoodle mission 11 “Alien Overlords: The Reality”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a collectible issue in Tunguska, now the music disc can be properly collected: Player reported issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bongwater can no longer randomly get stuck during the boss fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Re-balanced the building destruction with Sonic Boom",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed that collected tracks are in the Jukebox",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed audio issues in Bay City occurring in certain conditions after defeating Coyote Bongwater",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue after using the Slurbmaster in Arkvoodle mission “Publicity Stunt”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed inconsistencies in the voice lines for the prank calls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed that no more US military vehicles spawn in Takoshima when the alert level is raised",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed objective blocker with mission progression for the “The Siberian Job” rg. Sergei’s truck, spore cylinders, and the KGB cars",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed that the PK’ed objects do not get stuck in geometry when those objects are mission-relevant: Keep watching the skies (and watch out what's coming up your chimney)!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
